# Reference template. Verify against the actual hardware, gpsd/Chrony versions, and time sources before use.
# Do not overwrite system configurations without first reviewing and validating the settings.
#
# The following example assumes gpsd provides NMEA data to a Chrony SHM source
# and that the PPS device has been configured correctly.
# The device index and offset must be calibrated according to the experiment.
# refclock SHM 0 refid GPS precision 1e-1
# refclock PPS /dev/pps0 refid PPS lock GPS
#
# If NTP service is required, allow access only from the subnets
# needed for the experimental environment:
# allow 192.168.1.0/24
#
# Do not claim GPS lock or verified time accuracy based solely on
# the local stratum configuration.
